commit 68106660686232781bca3be792a750d3e19d7a8a
Author: thawk105 <thawk105@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Sep 21 21:16:17 2026 +0900

    feat(mocc): add TRACE-only lock coverage and permutation checks

    Add RWLOCK/CLL entry, pre-write and pre-publish lock coverage checks (X)
    and write-set size / record-pointer multiset preservation checks (P),
    all inside the existing #if TRACE blocks of cc/mocc/transaction.cc.

    The P check uses std::unordered_multiset<const void*>, which is supplied
    by the include/trace.hh include in the same TRACE branch, so the include
    lines of this file stay identical to e9e477ca (no #include is added).
    Seven #line directives restore the base source's logical line numbers.
    Relative to e9e477ca this commit changes only cc/mocc/transaction.cc.

    This is an Izanagi trace-hook candidate (TRACE=1 observation only). It
    does not advance the superproject pin and does not add write-intent (I)
    coverage. Design record: izanagi
    output/insights/2026-09-21/mocc-xp-pin-candidate section 3 and D2207.

